Package: luci-app-speedtest
Version: 1.0.0
Depends: uhttpd, luci-base, rpcd, ubus
Section: luci
Category: LuCI
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 270894
Maintainer: Void
Description: Speedtest dashboard for LuCI.
 Adds a Status -> Speedtest page that runs the Ookla CLI against broadband
 and through a WireGuard tunnel, logging both to CSV and plotting download,
 upload, latency, jitter and packet loss.
